## Actions quota fallback

- A zero-step billing block is standing and accepted where the plan runs over included Actions minutes; others stay blocked.
- Routine Issue PRs merge on a zero-step check, local verification, and a fallback note, without confirmation; promotion PRs to `main` keep the attestation/authorization procedure.
- Follow the complete SHA/tree-bound procedure, including the non-release promotion path, in [`docs/ci-policy.md`](docs/ci-policy.md#actions-額度-fallback). Never create or falsify a successful Check Run.

